tely to higher authorities. Record event details in the daily log for future reference. Special incident report form (paper-based) Deliver to the department head/advisor/department counselor for awareness. Hand over duty and coordinate with caring for students Assist in their recovery from injuries, guide them through the compensation settlement process, and provide timely assistance and guidance as needed. Enhance traffic safety education. Include information such as student enrollment, incident time, patterns, road sections, etc., in this year's traffic accident case statistical analysis. Use this data to propose improvements to traffic signals or road markings in hazardous areas. Are there any injuries or fatalities? Student Traffic Accident Handling Process"
