              "url": "https://www.osa.nchu.edu.tw/osa/laa/insurance/payment_standard_115-116.pdf",
              "text": "國立中興大學 115 學年度暨 116 學年度 學生團體保險繳費標準一覽表 National Chung Hsing University 115 and 116 Academic Year Student Group Insurance Payment Standards 單位：元 Unit: NTD 第 1 學期 First semester 第 2 學期 Second semester 類別 Category 校務基金補助 University endowment fund 自行負擔 Personal expense 校務基金補助 University endowment fund 自行負擔 Personal expense 免繳學雜費學生 Fee-exempt students 156 128 157 127 原住民身分學生 Indigenous students 156 128 157 127 一般學生 Regular students 50 234 50 234 大陸地區學生 Mainland Chinese students 0 284 0 284 1. 免繳學雜費學生係指持有低收入戶證明者，重度、極重度身心障礙學生及重度、 極重度身心障礙人士子女，惟不含公費生。 1. Students exempt from paying miscellaneous fees refer to those holding certification as low-income households, students with severe or profound physical or mental disabilities, and children of individuals with severe or profound physical or mental disabilities, excluding students receiving government subsidies. 2. 依大陸地區人民來臺就讀專科以上學校辦法應由就讀學校集體辦理學生團體保險， 保費由學校在每學期註冊費用內加列保險科目代收。 2. According to the regulations for residents of mainland China studying at colleges and universities above the junior college level in Taiwan, the school shall collectively arrange student group insurance, and the premium shall be included as a separate item in the registration fees collected each semester by the school."
