              "url": "https://www.osa.nchu.edu.tw/osa/hac/download/smokefree/sf05_1120614_4.pdf",
              "text": "1 國立中興大學校園菸害防制計畫 National Chung Hsing University Campus Tobacco Hazards Prevention Program. 112 年 6 月14 日 111 學年度第 2 學期學校衛生委員會通過 Passed by the 2022 academic year 2nd semester School Sanitation Committee on June 14, 2023. 壹、 依據 I. Basis 依據「菸害防制法」、「學校衛生法」及教育部 112 年 05 月 23 日修正「校園菸害防制實施 計畫」訂定本計畫。 This plan is formulated according to Tobacco Hazards Prevention Act, School Health Act and Campus Tobacco Hazards Prevention Implementation Program revised by Taiwan Ministry of Education on May 23rd, 2023. 貳、 目的 II. Purpose 為培養教職員工生自主健康管理的良好習慣，透過校內、外各項宣導活動，防制吸菸行為 及新興菸品（如電子煙）等危害，維護及促進全體教職員工生健康，建立無菸校園環境。 In order to cultivate the good habit of autonomous and healthy management of faculty members, staff members and students, prevent and control hazards of smoking behavior and emerging cigarettes (e.g. electronic cigarettes), etc., maintain and promote health of all faculty members, staff members and students, and build smoke-free campus environment through various propaganda activities. 參、 計畫目標 III. Program Target 一、 降低學生吸菸率。 1. Reduce smoking rate of students. 二、 降低教職員工吸菸率。 2. Reduce smoking rate of faculty members and staff members. 三、 降低學生暴露於校園二手菸比率。 3. Reduce students’ exposure rate to campus second-hand smoking. 四、 建立校園拒菸氛圍，維護教職員工生健康。 4. Create campus tobacco-free atmosphere and maintain health of faculty members, staff members and students. 肆、 具體作法 IV . Concrete Methods 一、菸害防制政策 2 1. Tobacco Hazards Prevention and Control Policy (一) 配合健康促進學校計畫與教育部菸害防制計畫，由「學校衛生委員會」訂定校園 菸害防制計畫，推動校園菸害防制工作。本校菸害防制推動分工表如附檔一。 (1) In line with Health Promotion Program of the University and Tobacco Hazards Prevention and Control Program of Taiwan Ministry of Education, School Health Committee shall formulate campus tobacco hazards prevention and control program, and advance campus tobacco hazards prevention and control work. Tobacco hazards prevention and control division table of the University is shown in Attachment 1. (二) 校園內全面禁菸(紙菸、電子煙、各類菸品)，若發現攜帶或吸食電子菸者，得請 本校駐警隊規勸與制止。 (2) Tobaccos (including cigarettes, electronic cigarettes and various cigarettes) are completely forbidden on the campus. If anyone is found carrying or vaping electronic cigarettes, the security guards of the University are allowed to exhort and prevent them. (三) 訂定菸害事件處理流程，本校菸害處理流程如附檔二。 (3) Tobacco hazards incidents handling flow shall be formulated. Tobacco hazards handling flow of the University is shown in Attachment 2. (四) 積極倡導戒菸活動、校園不販售菸品及設置吸菸區，維護無菸校園環境。 (4) Smoking cessation activities shall be advocated actively. It is not allowed to sell cigarettes or set up smoking areas on the campus, and smoke-free environment shall be well maintained. (五) 結合臺中市衛生局、南區衛生所及本地醫療機構，不定期辦理教職員工生 CO 檢 測。 (5) Cooperations shall be carried out with Health Bureau of Taichung City Government, Southern District Public Health Center and local medical institutions to carry out CO examination on faculty members, staff members and students irregularly. 二、菸害防制教育 2. Tobacco Hazards Prevention and Control Education (一) 健康教育教師、護理人員、輔導人員等，參加有關戒菸教育及生活技能之培訓課 程，對於種子教師推動戒菸教育績效優良者予以獎勵。 (1) Teachers, nursing personnel and guidance personnel for health education shall take training courses about smoking cessation and life skills. Seeded teachers with excellent performance in promoting smoking cessation education shall be rewarded. (二) 針對有意願戒菸之教職員工生提供戒菸相關服務及資源或轉介至專業戒菸醫療機 構。 (2) For faculty members, staff members and students who are willing to give up smoking, relevant services and resources shall be provided, or they can be provided with referral service to professional smoking cessation medical institutions. (三) 辦理或結合衛生與醫療等機構相關資源，對吸菸學生實施戒菸教育活動，包括戒 菸教育團體課程及個別輔導等。 3 (3) Smoking cessation education activities shall be implemented to smoking students, including smoking cessation education group course and individual coaching, by handling with or combining relevant resources of sanitary and medical institutions and other institutions. (四) 與本地之戒菸治療機構合作，轉介校內有吸菸之教職員工生接受戒菸諮商與戒菸 治療。 (4) Cooperations shall be carried out with local smoking cessation treatment facilities to provide referral service to faculty members, staff members and students for smoking cessation counseling and treatment. 三、營造無菸環境 3. Create Smoke-free Environment (一) 確實遵守菸害防制法，訂定本校室內、外場所禁止吸菸的管理規範，以建構無菸 害校園環境。 (1) Formulate no-smoking management regulations for indoor and outdoor places of the University by exactly following Tobacco Hazards Prevention Act to create smoke-free campus environment. (二) 加強健康無菸校園環境布置，如張貼禁菸警語、海報及布條等相關標語。 (2) Strengthen setting of healthy and smoke-free campus environment, such as posting no- smoking warnings, posters, banners and other relevant slogans. (三) 加強校園安全巡邏稽查，取締學生之吸菸行為，並嚴禁校內便利商店及販賣物品 之廠商在校園內販賣各式菸品。 (3) Intensify campus safety patrol inspection and forbid smoking behavior of students. Campus convenience stores and outsourcers are strictly banned to sell various cigarettes on campus. (四) 與廠商簽訂契約時，增訂禁止於校園內吸菸等條款，落實遵照菸害防制相關規 定。 (4) When concluding contracts with outsourcers, articles like banning smoking on campus shall be added. Such articles shall be performed according to relevant stipulations about tobacco hazards prevention and control. 四、菸害防制工作要項 4. Important Matters of Tobacco Hazards Prevention and Control (一) 教職員工應以身作則反菸、拒菸，並對所屬班級加強宣導，在校園若發現吸菸之 學生，宜給予勸導或依本校學生菸害事件處理流程辦理，教職員工違規部份，請 主政單位填具獎懲建議表，統一簽報首長核定後，移請人事室依本校職員獎懲要 點提送考績委員會審議。 (1) The faculty and stuff shall lead by example to object to smoking and refuse to smoke, and propagandize affiliated classes of them. If a student is found smoking on campus, they shall be exhorted or handled according to tobacco hazards handling flow for the student of the University. As for violation of the faculty members and staff members, the major administrative unit will be responsible for filling in reward and punishment opinion forms. After such forms are uniformly signed and approved by the head of the University, such 4 forms shall be transferred to the Office of Personnel and then submitted to Merit Rating Committee for deliberation according to National Chung Hsing University Guidelines for Staff Rewards and Penalties. (二) 各學院應對區域內違反菸害防制法者依菸害事件處理流程辦理，各系責任區域由 各學院自行決定劃分。 (2) For anyone who violates Tobacco Hazards Prevention Act, all colleges shall deal with violators in line with tobacco hazards handling flow. Responsible areas of all departments shall be divided at sole discretion of all colleges. 伍、 預期效益 V. Expected Benefits 一、 建構教職員工生無菸支持性環境。 1. Create smoke-free supportive environment for faculty members, staff members and students. 二、 發展學生族群拒菸及戒菸之個人技巧。 2. Develop personal skills for student groups to refuse to smoke and abandon smoking. 三、 提供教職員工生多元、可近之戒菸服務。 3. Provide diversified and accessible smoking cessation services to faculty members, staff members and students. 陸、 本計畫經學校衛生委員會議通過後實施，修正時亦同。 VI.This Program is implemented after being approved by School Health Committee. It is the same with revision. 5 附件一 國立中興大學菸害防制分工表 Attachment 1. Tobacco Hazards Prevention and Control Division Table of National Chung Hsing University 單位/職稱 Unit/Professional Title 分工職掌 Division of Responsibilities 校長 President 校園菸害防治指揮 Commander of campus tobacco hazards prevention and control. 教務處 Office of Academic Affairs 將校園禁菸、菸品危害與戒菸等議題融入專業課程或通識課程教學。 Incorporate campus no-smoking rules, tobacco hazards, smoking cessation and other subjects into teaching of professional courses or general education curriculum. 學生事務處 Office of Student Affairs 【健康及諮商中心】 [Health and Counseling Center] 1. 推動校園菸害防制之衛生教育與宣導計畫。 1.Promote sanitation education and propaganda programs of campus tobacco prevention and control. 2. 提供戒菸醫療諮詢及轉介鄰近醫療院所戒菸門診。 2. Provide smoking cessation medical consultation and referral service to smoking cessation clinic of adjacent medical institutions. 3. 提供接受戒菸治療之心理支持與輔導。 3. Provide psychological support and counseling about acceptance of smoking cessation treatment. 4. 協助衛生單位稽查校內菸害防制工作。 4. Assist sanitation units to inspect campus tobacco hazards prevention and control work. 【學生安全輔導室】 [Student Safely 